# Credits

## Original Work
EliteWrite is based on VoiceInk, an open-source macOS voice-to-text
application created by Beingpax.

- Original project: https://github.com/Beingpax/VoiceInk
- Original author: Beingpax
- License: GPL v3.0

## EliteWrite Modifications (© 2026 ExecEdgePro)
The following modifications were made to the original VoiceInk codebase:

- Full rebrand from VoiceInk to EliteWrite
- Elite Focus Session Mode with timer, pause tracking, and Focus Score
- Focus Score algorithm (TIME / PAUSES / OUTPUT components)
- Unified Session History View with full transcript detail
- Identity tag (Early Access Build versioning)
- Dashboard statistics and savings summary
- Help & Resources section
- Affiliate program card management
- UI/UX copy pass across all views
- CR-010 compliance (brand language standards)

